          "docs": "Creates or updates a metric stream. Metric streams can automatically stream CloudWatch metrics to a Amazon Kinesis Data Firehose delivery stream, or to Amazon S3 via a Kinesis Data Firehose delivery stream. The output includes metric data in one of two formats, JSON or the OpenTelemetry 0.7.0 protobuf format."
